STATEMENT
by their nature, the goods cannot normally be returned by post

Do these sentences, on their own and taken together, state that the statement is false? Answer yes or no with one line of reason.
Answer with one JSON object that follows the JSON schema below. Output only the JSON, with no other text.

JSON SCHEMA
{
  "properties": {
    "answer": {
      "description": "yes if the sentence on its own states it, otherwise no",
      "enum": [
        "yes",
        "no"
      ],
      "title": "Answer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "reason": {
      "description": "One line of reason",
      "title": "Reason",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "answer",
    "reason"
  ],
  "title": "VerifierOutputV2",
  "type": "object"
}
